vault.tooltip.controller.1=Hollow 3x3x3: outward controller at the center of any face.
vault.tooltip.controller.2=Other shell cells: 23 LuV machine casings and 1 standard GT input bus.
vault.tooltip.controller.3=Add 1 link hatch OR export bus; ports are exclusive and cannot be shared.
vault.tooltip.controller.4=Insert storage cells/components into the input bus; absorbed each second.
vault.tooltip.controller.5=Filled cells migrate contents/cards first; cells and housings are consumed.
vault.tooltip.controller.6=Right-click for capacity, structure checks and automatic absorption.
vault.tooltip.controller.7=Normal harvesting retains stock binding; back up the complete world.
vault.tooltip.access.1=Install in any shell cell of ME Cell Aggregation Storage.
vault.tooltip.access.2=Exactly 1 link hatch OR export bus per machine; never share components.
vault.tooltip.access.3=AE connection: 1 channel, idle 2 AE/t; mounts item/fluid storage directly.
vault.tooltip.access.4=Right-click for native AE priority: higher inserts first, lower extracts first.
vault.tooltip.access.5=Supports terminals, crafting and Reshuffle; offline/broken structures pause access.
vault.tooltip.output.1=Replaces the storage link hatch; cannot be shared between structures.
vault.tooltip.output.2=Connect to the destination AE grid: 1 channel, idle 2 AE/t plus transfer power.
vault.tooltip.output.3=Actively injects type batches; source stock is not mounted in the grid.
vault.tooltip.output.4=Right-click for 36 item/fluid phantom filters with NEI drag-and-drop.
vault.tooltip.output.5=Empty filters export all; precise whitelists find their type without scanning stock.
vault.tooltip.output.6=Supports one fuzzy, inverter and ore-filter card each.
vault.tooltip.output.7=Non-empty ore expressions override markers; full/offline grids retain stock.
vault.tooltip.output.8=Disconnect AE to pause export; controller toggle affects cell absorption only.
